#: scenario2:scenario2_06F5E9DF_EEC6_449D_867F_7CCC7B9DBC15
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b9fd299206464c20b2d8e42196a57113dfc04608fd596a1282ca8efe901709ee
