msgid "⟪k:0⟫—then perhaps I could accept that this was fate."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫これも運命と納得出来るのでしょう。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_0D9836CF_2E04_465E_AD33_1FF209D3EE19
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 738bdf8ed2ddf65e7248a519a2c72b9c9118da24562370c41ed7634eb5085d21
