msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I will have a room prepared."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫寝台の用意はさせる。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_CA08BF9C_645C_4E41_835C_FC6FECF870BB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
