msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_4085474D_5FA7_4CF4_ABDB_FDCE6F5B07F2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I have been wandering for a very, very long time."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫\t⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ずいぶんと長く……彷徨っていたものですから……。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_E8E33C0F_1C5D_4935_86C2_6AEC7C6A29BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8b5238f262805aa35c9106670b1fd1d4734b23263f641e9d611de56c32cbceb3
#. default-sha256: ce0db8cd85a07eba497e39725de91cdf6e2183cdf074bc359321a8ba70c62e5b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E8E33C0F_1C5D_4935_86C2_6AEC7C6A29BE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What was that, Master? ⟪k:1⟫You recognize her?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫まあ、⟪k:1⟫旦那さま。⟪k:2⟫見覚えのある娘ですって？"

#: scenario2:scenario2_0789AA8F_5FF4_4FC9_AC02_874445FF7FDD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ccc8c6a1423a5c1c9d72a797be9111e2c70c09a4a1bca68c3a9945de1c11614b
#. default-sha256: 5cd8b114c805867d505bb9894e39abf1a08d03de23701e31224b541512541636
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_0789AA8F_5FF4_4FC9_AC02_874445FF7FDD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I imagine you would. ⟪k:1⟫That white hair, those red eyes, skin the color of freshly fallen "
"snow."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それもそのはずでございますわ。⟪k:1⟫白い髪に赤い瞳――真冬に降り注ぐ雪のような白い肌。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_2E741487_927A_4B6B_8150_D002B616BB04
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b0df898cc064c7456f0c359b49d1cf5dbc88f3386c29fb8183c13f8c569707db
#. default-sha256: b368be83b44af5c210893806ac0beabe73425e80d7291a5375b6bcef36c36c84
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2E741487_927A_4B6B_8150_D002B616BB04"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And that flawlessly beautiful visage... ⟪k:1⟫you could not possibly mistake her for anyone "
"else. ⟪k:2⟫And no, it is not someone who happens to resemble her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫そして整った美しい顔立ち……⟪k:1⟫見間違うはずもございません。⟪k:2⟫他人の空似などではございませ"
"ん。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_58773568_08FB_4D1E_82D8_4F1AA27D2A86
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f29cd5fb2fea93383e75e284fe79914b8683a7f9152b7cdef578c30931275bfb
#. default-sha256: 2cb53a1b6ba7cb97ae3635db1506d7ad65f5e93b6a0cf3f7ddaa8dd79589197e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_58773568_08FB_4D1E_82D8_4F1AA27D2A86"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I can understand why you would be surprised, Master. ⟪k:1⟫At first, I could hardly believe "
"my own eyes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫旦那さま、⟪k:1⟫驚きになるのは分かりますわ。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫わたくしも始めは、⟪k:4⟫目を疑うばかりで"
"したもの。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_DE5B9B47_1A1E_40BC_B96E_D4A5B1CFF55C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 621b0e0f753ef9153fb1523615bb17058d14e2079a32da14e70bb83dfd47b1b4
#. default-sha256: fe3a2236cc08ca0c5c4dba31211ab698a4d131b81a724db533af860535a1137d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_DE5B9B47_1A1E_40BC_B96E_D4A5B1CFF55C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The wanderer knocking on the door that day was the very same fair-skinned young woman who "
"visited the mansion so many years earlier."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫屋敷の門を叩いたその客人こそ、⟪k:1⟫かつてこのお屋敷を訪れた、⟪k:2⟫透き通る肌を持つあの乙女"
"だったのです。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_A12E6328_D57E_43F8_BB1B_8C4C5F88215D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea340d79d36bd5282a9a6dda2470c5606e571709dead85d562f8f33a48d44f8b
#. default-sha256: 4b5c90ac9af91614e9d663292fa5a99d7c60af3de6701e30c056d93c46d98d8f
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A12E6328_D57E_43F8_BB1B_8C4C5F88215D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl must have spent many, many a night in the forest."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫白い髪の娘も、⟪k:1⟫たくさんの夜を森で過ごしたのでしょう。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_E877D490_31D4_4AAE_A8F4_3729423D1083
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a660f770eed7895264756fc0ed30ccb25692716b1c679821ffe72b2b384f7a8f
#. default-sha256: 954efddd61dcca018d9fe55b0db1a22725eaa25dedac7ddddaf0332dd2e4a7a0
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E877D490_31D4_4AAE_A8F4_3729423D1083"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her crystalline skin was covered in red scratches from where she had brushed against stray "
"branches and tree bark. She had even lost her shoes, and was standing there barefooted, looking "
"quite disheartened."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫玉のような肌は剥き出しの枝や樹皮に傷つけられて赤く染まり、⟪k:1⟫靴すらも失ったのか可哀想な裸足"
"で心細く立っておりました。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_CBB6BF74_20E5_4572_B7D3_72A11D316931
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e1eab457a8b42574411fc32e891f3dc7d6f7f4f2ffed900d302f92d6fdf9a13
#. default-sha256: 042d284be688d7cb1785ec58e08997e0233a29737879596381cfe9fa74d1ee9a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CBB6BF74_20E5_4572_B7D3_72A11D316931"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But that did not make her any less beautiful. In fact, you could just imagine the dense "
"forest canopy parting to allow the sun to shine down upon her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫それでも彼女の美しさは損なわれず、⟪k:1⟫鬱蒼と生い茂る森も彼女のために光を覚えるくらいでした。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_F2F71829_F774_4155_83C7_9178873C2A08
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c414b285ef22d51af68fc7f2b763db178a82d848e211a5055e8888144206c322
#. default-sha256: 10b5f662b59390c72e1db2bae3a2beaa586b17b46f912f988dc0a341c42ae314
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_F2F71829_F774_4155_83C7_9178873C2A08"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫…………。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_9F0927F3_EB0A_49F1_8830_CBE0CA231BCA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b6f570a8cdbf3e9919491dd2933c2de5cf5d75e1bc27d951f5a1a36fe54ec60d
#. default-sha256: 70b42784d7c2e9aed0b34e2f379e581ceabfe16577acb1bd016fa47ad1e6d787
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_9F0927F3_EB0A_49F1_8830_CBE0CA231BCA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The beast appeared surprised by her angelic beauty as well. ⟪k:1⟫It seemed as though all the "
"madness drained from him in that moment."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫獣も驚いているようでした。⟪k:1⟫彼女の美しさに、⟪k:2⟫神々しさに。⟪k:3⟫その瞬間、⟪k:4⟫獣から狂"
"気が抜けおちたように思えましたわ。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_6EF0A4AB_CE19_4C16_9E79_AFFE0E0D292A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a8d2bf05e5540ae24627909ecffcf86a0a90039d1a40836719baae8b564c6342
#. default-sha256: 2fd265f6b7732fe7ba0183cd103d695e3e12405a229e025a3cdb55c0bac57e32
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_6EF0A4AB_CE19_4C16_9E79_AFFE0E0D292A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫....................."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………………。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_6D4B969B_BC5B_41D1_90C0_4EC4FFA290FF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2ec2f79ee9008f63f5981edd3f6a9941e5e289bc0ee8227308c80526e9d35ce5
#. default-sha256: 739246280c0b33b8859c4a404d5e7e52193348ac23ea755aca3867e28faf1e92
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_6D4B969B_BC5B_41D1_90C0_4EC4FFA290FF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He said nothing, but his eyes told all."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫獣は何も言いません。⟪k:1⟫けれど彼の瞳が物語るのです。"

