msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They traced his distinctive frame; they ran along his unusually shaped nose; they slid "
"across his rough, yellowed skin; they drifted around his rather small eyes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫それが、⟪k:1⟫骨格の異なる輪郭を、⟪k:2⟫形の異なる鼻を、⟪k:3⟫ざらついた黄ばんだ肌を、⟪k:4⟫娘の"
"瞳より随分と小さな目元を、⟪k:5⟫辿っていきます。"

