msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Taken in the throes of his primal urges, the beast had not noticed, but there was an "
"emptiness in the girl’s eyes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫そうですわ、⟪k:1⟫獣は自分の衝動にかまけて気付いておりませんでしたが、⟪k:2⟫娘の瞳はどこかしら"
"虚ろでございました。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_651C1431_471A_41B0_B289_FA29C125ADDE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 46c2e593afc111560b86218774021c362e667355638744d79226d8627e21a730
