msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tears had begun running down Bestia’s cheeks earlier—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫when she had called him a "
"person."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ベステアが涙を流し始めたのは、⟪k:1⟫もっと前のこと。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫彼女が獣を、⟪k:4⟫人だと告げた時"
"から。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_A8CC8189_A609_4FA4_8E7B_3113430A1ED6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bc55fcf6b4429b1b03355508476d6e9b8985ea433c8998823353764376620484
