msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She would, indeed, have no need of extravagant dresses—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫after all, she could not "
"see what she was wearing."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫絢爛なドレスも必要がないはずです。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫彼女には見えないのですから。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_645A19A9_4D1A_45F3_8D14_DF9B0BBD9175
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7a63c37d87a4b0f521f6ee56927e237f44b527153c2c4dc33a8c1022cf4d81b9
