msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_645A19A9_4D1A_45F3_8D14_DF9B0BBD9175"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That is correct; I am blind...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But who ever decided that reality is only that which "
"can be seen?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫いかにも、⟪k:1⟫私は盲目の身です……。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫しかし目に見えるもののみが真実だと、⟪k:4⟫誰が決"
"めたのでしょうか。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_3520CD30_9B22_4B24_A869_88E7B38DC357
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d46e291c1ff903557e83e7951a34fab4eaf846f446444ebd05884577078fbc17
