"⟪k:0⟫But you know rather well, Master, that the White-Haired Girl was not at all what you would "
"call a beast."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫しかし旦那さま、⟪k:1⟫お分かりでしょう？ ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫\t白い髪の娘が到底獣とは遠いものであること"
"など。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_C5F8E918_0E88_4054_BC3A_7461BBBD5E9E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c6175a65b780e6f21a2251cadf9a111bcd051c572612b313ca050712ebd5f68
