msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her words brought him faint pain, but the beast still felt, on some level, that he wanted to "
"keep her at his side. To see what would happen."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫獣は少し、⟪k:1⟫傷つきました。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫傷つきながら、⟪k:4⟫彼女を傍に置いてみたいと思ってし"
"まったのです。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_1DBC9231_F152_4E0A_9F32_4372EB81F449
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: afa8a5c0dc42b6eeb01e4b32d243b897db89ae382eb08d230ec325cfea6a643f
