msgid "⟪k:0⟫His next words were in large part impulsive."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それは半ば、⟪k:1⟫衝動と言えたでしょう。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_1DC255A9_C3A5_4CEE_A646_B2B4EE311868
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d7c3c03d98c3bb83c3b11829ce8050bfee269ff9c52d371e56b5912c08849dee
